WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.792 --> 00:00:01.627
Firstly...

00:00:02.461 --> 00:00:04.838
an angel appears
to prophesy.

00:00:06.089 --> 00:00:09.051
The angel says the name
of the recipient first.

00:00:09.927 --> 00:00:12.012
They are then told
when they will die,

00:00:12.095 --> 00:00:13.680
and that they are bound
for Hell.

00:00:14.723 --> 00:00:16.266
When the time comes,

00:00:17.142 --> 00:00:18.310
the executors of Hell...

00:00:19.394 --> 00:00:21.522
are going to fulfill
the prophesy.

00:00:23.982 --> 00:00:25.943
If you're watching this
for the first time,

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:27.486
you may find this shocking.

00:00:27.569 --> 00:00:29.112
He looks completely normal.

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:31.949
But why is he bullshitting
everyone?

00:00:32.032 --> 00:00:33.283
I couldn't
believe it either.

00:00:33.367 --> 00:00:35.077
Wait, people actually
believe this crap?

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:38.080
Yeah, There are a lot
of people who believe it.

00:00:38.163 --> 00:00:40.082
He has a bunch of videos
that back him

00:00:40.165 --> 00:00:41.208
on his YouTube channel.

00:00:41.291 --> 00:00:42.167
Okay, yeah.

00:00:42.251 --> 00:00:44.086
Con men like him
can exploit people

00:00:44.169 --> 00:00:45.587
because of idiots like you.

00:00:46.338 --> 00:00:48.549
Don't take this seriously,
all right?

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:53.303
Wait, you are taking this
seriously, aren't you?

00:00:53.387 --> 00:00:54.346
So?

00:00:54.429 --> 00:00:56.598
Watch it again and see
if you still feel the same.

00:00:56.682 --> 00:00:59.476
-This is all CGI!
-No, it's not.

00:01:49.234 --> 00:01:50.819
-What's going on?
